    1415/    1960 :                     		; The above code does not properly 'pop' the 16th PLC entry.
    1416/    1960 :                     		; Because of this, occupying the 16th slot will cause it to
    1417/    1960 :                     		; be repeatedly decompressed infinitely.
    1418/    1960 :                     		; Granted, this could be conisdered more of an optimisation
    1419/    1960 :                     		; than a bug: treating the 16th entry as a dummy that
