(1)  283/   13E66 :                     ; Conveyor belt corner target coordinate definitions.
(1)  284/   13E66 :                     ; Each group corresponds to the lower nybble of the given subtype.
(1)  285/   13E66 :                     ; Format:
(1)  286/   13E66 :                     ; 	dc.w number of entries, times 4
(1)  287/   13E66 :                     ; 	dc.w base X position (used for out_of_range check)
(1)  288/   13E66 :                     ; 	dc.w entries...
(1)  289/   13E66 :                     ; Entries consist of a target X position and target Y position.
